the Coromandel Range where they'd sent their final letter home. The owner of a general store recalled speaking to a couple who matched Urban and Heidi's description late in the afternoon on Thursday, April 6. They sought directions to Tararu Creek Road. Located at the top end of town, the Dead End Road granted access to a 12km bush track that led up to Table Mountain. From there, the couple intended to go down into Kawaronga Valley where they would hitch a ride back to their car.
